        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 70.6" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="588" ed="#liebermann"/>Si Anglicus<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="17" target="#Hn_70-6.lnote.oe.17"/> homo Dacum occidat, liber liberum, persoluat eum XXV libr.<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="18" target="#Hn_70-6.lnote.oe.18"/>; uel ipse malefactor reddatur. Et tantundem reddat Dacus de Anglico, si eum occidat.</ab>
